        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naroike </strong>is a casual side-scrolling game that combines roguelite and hack-and-slash elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a wide variety of artifacts and use your skills to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strengthen not only your equipment but also your skill tree to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep growing, and enjoy fast-paced, exhilarating battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique artifacts to choose from, you can equip up to 10 at a time to create the ultimate build that suits your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right combination of artifacts can lead to various strategies, such as a high-damage one-shot build, a balanced and stable approach, or even a risk-taking setup that gets stronger the more damage you take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, some artifacts come with Action Skills, further expanding your combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond artifacts, the Skill Tree allows you to enhance your character permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress that stays with you – even if you die, your upgrades remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats and embed runes found in battle to unlock even greater abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Skill Tree with artifacts to become an unstoppable warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some artifacts are equipped with Action Skills, giving you a major edge in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating attacks to crush enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing skills to survive in dire situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status effects to disrupt and control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your skills and carve out your own unique fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Formidable Foes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 100 meters, a powerful boss awaits. Defeating them will reward you with permanent artifacts that you can keep even after death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger the further you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more powerful artifacts you can obtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost System (Hard Mode)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hard Mode, you can obtain more powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, all artifacts and equipment you collect during your adventure will be lost upon death...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you proceed cautiously, watching for the perfect moment to retreat, or take the risk and delve deeper? That decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose everything if you die—but if you face the challenge with courage, even greater power awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, and to reach the farthest depths, push beyond your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naroike </strong>is a casual side-scrolling game that combines roguelite and hack-and-slash elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a wide variety of artifacts and use your skills to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strengthen not only your equipment but also your skill tree to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep growing, and enjoy fast-paced, exhilarating battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/202d18b47678704a3e7fae317babd601.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique artifacts to choose from, you can equip up to 10 at a time to create the ultimate build that suits your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right combination of artifacts can lead to various strategies, such as a high-damage one-shot build, a balanced and stable approach, or even a risk-taking setup that gets stronger the more damage you take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, some artifacts come with Action Skills, further expanding your combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.poster.avif?t=1758151765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.webm?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566730/extras/431e2cb86cc60f2407c4f6faf9546b29.mp4?t=1758151765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond artifacts, the Skill Tree allows you to enhance your character permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress that stays with you – even if you die, your upgrades remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats and embed runes found in battle to unlock even greater abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Skill Tree with artifacts to become an unstoppable warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Skills</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some artifacts are equipped with Action Skills, giving you a major edge in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating attacks to crush enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing skills to survive in dire situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status effects to disrupt and control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your skills and carve out your own unique fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Formidable Foes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 100 meters, a powerful boss awaits. Defeating them will reward you with permanent artifacts that you can keep even after death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger the further you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more powerful artifacts you can obtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost System (Hard Mode)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hard Mode, you can obtain more powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, all artifacts and equipment you collect during your adventure will be lost upon death...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you proceed cautiously, watching for the perfect moment to retreat, or take the risk and delve deeper? That decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose everything if you die—but if you face the challenge with courage, even greater power awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, and to reach the farthest depths, push beyond your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
